# Tamiyo, Upriser Crowned: the trigger is for combat damage dealt "to you". Bot1 is the monarch and attacks Bot2 with
# Tamiyo (haste, flying, double strike: 3 + 3 damage), so Tamiyo is no creature that dealt damage to Bot1 and gets no
# stun counter and is not tapped by the trigger (she is tapped only by attacking, and double strike leaves her so).

